## Xcode per-user state
## The .xcodeproj itself is committed (see ADR 0006 and the spec's Structure
## section) — only the per-user slice of it is ignored.
xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Packages/
Package.resolved

## Playgrounds
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

## Secrets — the Anthropic key lives in the Keychain (ADR 0002), never on disk.
## This is belt-and-braces against a local override file being committed.
*.xcconfig.local
Secrets.xcconfig
